.PP
construction of region from nodes, relying on existing node-parent-element connectivity to identify elements construction from nodes only, relying on existing node-parent-element connectivity to identify elements

.PP
the assumption is made that the node pointers are unique\&.

.PP
the element vector is also sorted for searching\&.

.PP
the elements are identified by looping over the parents of the nodes, then additional nodes are added where necessary to capture a halo for the pressure equation\&. 
